menu "arena_sizing example"

    config EXAMPLE_SHOW_INIT_EXHAUSTION
        bool "End with an init-time registration the arena cannot hold"
        default n
        help
            After the run-time refusal, call register_vertex once more. It is
            infallible (ADR-0056), so libtracer prints the sizing message naming
            the sub-pool and the bytes it needed, then aborts. On a board that
            abort is a reset, so this is off by default.

endmenu
